<blockquote>
<p>Isn't this page and project necessary forDocument Leaks?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I would say no, it's definitely not necessary. That said, it's been noted several times in the Document Leaks thread that some of the proposed &quot;document leaks&quot; are kind of a really bad idea to attempt. I personally don't think it's a great idea to encourage anyone to pretend-leak documents for a horror site to people who don't actually want to read horror site stuff (or would be pretty negatively affected by reading said horror site stuff). Friends and family who can be sat down and talked to about how it's not real, sure, but total strangers is kinda iffy.</p>

